>**Increase nation's Prosperity.**
=2 Walkthrough
+ Head to (I-5) in {z:East Ronfaure (S)}. Click on the ??? you find there to spawn two {m:Goblin Picaroons|Goblin Picaroon}.
+ After killing the NMs, check the ??? again to complete the quest. Make sure to examine the ??? or you will fail when you return.

=2 Notes
* The {m:Goblin Picaroons|Goblin Picaroon} spawn as {p:BLM|Black Mage} and {p:WHM|White Mage} with no difference in name, only weapon and spell usage. The WHM wields a staff whereas the BLM wields a dagger.
* Killable by: __(see {p:testimonials|https://ffxiclopedia.fandom.com/wiki/Talk:Delta_Strike_II_(San_d'Oria)})__
* Be sure to engage both mobs when they spawn. Do not pull one away from the other, as they will despawn and you will fail the mission.
* The NMs have a rage timer at around 10-20 minutes. They then behave as a raged mob would if the mob is not killed within the time limit; resisting spells and dealing far greater amounts of damage.
* Others assisting with the fight may also check the ??? after the win for an exp/limit reward regardless of whether they have the mission active. However. if they do not have the mission active, they will not receive Allied Notes or credit for the victory.

